      "text": "I  am choosing an existing template \nof creating ec2 instance\nhere is the code\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "I  am choosing an existing template \nof creating ec2 instance\nhere is the code\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "crfbvWj5qByBYOg715j6c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 243.99999999999997,
      "y": 1883,
      "width": 419.9723284559913,
      "height": 275.20001220703125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b28",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 490373457,
      "version": 34,
      "versionNonce": 88330399,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1775193471443,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "AWSTemplateFormatVersion: '2010-09-09'\nDescription: Create an EC2 instance with a security group for SSH access\nResources:\n  InstanceSecurityGroup:\n    Type: AWS::EC2::SecurityGroup\n    Properties:\n      GroupDescription: Enable SSH access\n      SecurityGroupIngress:\n        - IpProtocol: tcp\n          FromPort: 22\n          ToPort: 22\n          CidrIp: 0.0.0.0/0\n  MyInstance:\n    Type: AWS::EC2::Instance\n    Properties:\n      ImageId: ami-0440d3b780d96b29d\n      InstanceType: t2.micro\n      SecurityGroups:\n        - !Ref InstanceSecurityGroup",
      "fontSize": 11.5873689350329,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "AWSTemplateFormatVersion: '2010-09-09'\nDescription: Create an EC2 instance with a security group for SSH access\nResources:\n  InstanceSecurityGroup:\n    Type: AWS::EC2::SecurityGroup\n    Properties:\n      GroupDescription: Enable SSH access\n      SecurityGroupIngress:\n        - IpProtocol: tcp\n          FromPort: 22\n          ToPort: 22\n          CidrIp: 0.0.0.0/0\n  MyInstance:\n    Type: AWS::EC2::Instance\n    Properties:\n      ImageId: ami-0440d3b780d96b29d\n      InstanceType: t2.micro\n      SecurityGroups:\n        - !Ref InstanceSecurityGroup",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
